  "goodToKnow": "Die Rhetorik is rhetoric, the art of persuasive speaking: ein Rhetorikkurs, rhetorisch begabt. It can be negative too: leere Rhetorik (empty rhetoric). Eine rhetorische Frage is a question asked for effect, not for an answer. The Rh is just an r sound, as in Rhein and Rhythmus. From Greek rhetorike. German politicians famous for their Rhetorik include Willy Brandt and Gregor Gysi."
